    "min_calibration_per_stratum": 1,
    "n_calibration_rule": "total = floor(calibration_share x n_candidates); quota of a tercile = n_days x total / n_candidates; each tercile gets floor(quota), raised to min_calibration_per_stratum for a non-empty tercile when the total is at least the number of non-empty terciles; the remaining days go one each to the largest fractional remainders, ties in the seeded permutation's order",
